== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Greydwarf brutes|Aggressive creature strategies#Greydwarf brute}}

=== Attack ===
Slams their rock downwards, extending outwards 3 meters in a 45-degree vertical arc (30 [[Damage types#Blunt|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 2 seconds when within 1.8 meters of a player.

